"description":"Your encrypted vault, connected to the server you control.\nVaultwarden Client is an independent iPhone and iPad app for users who already have access to a compatible self-hosted Vaultwarden server. Connect to your own server and manage credentials through a native Apple-platform experience.\nMANAGE YOUR VAULT\n• Store logins, secure notes, cards, identities, and SSH keys\n• Organize items with personal folders and shared collections\n• Access an encrypted offline copy of your vault\n• Create, edit, archive, restore, and delete vault items\n• Sync changes automatically when your server becomes available  \nAUTOFILL AND PASSKEYS\n• Fill usernames and passwords in apps and websites\n• Fill time-based verification codes\n• Search your vault when no automatic match is found\n• Create and save passwords directly from AutoFill\n• Register and use passkeys with device authentication  \nGENERATE STRONG CREDENTIALS\nCreate strong passwords, memorable passphrases, and unique usernames. Generated values use clear character styling and can be copied when needed.\nSHARE ENCRYPTED SENDS\nShare encrypted text or files using your server. Protect Sends with a password, expiration time, deletion date, and access limits.\nSECURITY RECOMMENDATIONS\nReview weak, reused, and exposed passwords. Password breach checks use a privacy-preserving range request, so the complete password and complete hash never leave your device.\nPROTECTED ON YOUR DEVICE\n• Unlock with Face ID, Touch ID, or device authentication\n• Store session material in iOS Keychain\n• Automatically lock the app when it is no longer active\n• Keep the offline vault and pending changes encrypted\n• No advertising, cross-app tracking, or third-party analytics  \nA compatible self-hosted Vaultwarden server and an existing account are required. This app does not provide server hosting.\nVaultwarden Client is an independent client and is not affiliated with or endorsed by Bitwarden, Inc. or the Vaultwarden project.", "trackCensoredName":"Vaultwarden Password Manager", "trackViewUrl":"https://apps.apple.com/pt/app/vaultwarden-password-manager/id6799711599?uo=4", "contentAdvisoryRating":"4+", "bundleId":"xyz.0xmwehehe.vaultwardenApp", "averageUserRating":0, "releaseDate":"2026-08-26T07:00:00Z", "userRatingCount":0}]
